{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/796","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/796/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/796/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/796/events","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/dubbo/issues/796","id":269999107,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyNjk5OTkxMDc=","number":796,"title":"在Spring Boot中运行Dubbo消费端报错frozen class (cannot edit)","user":{"login":"rong1981","id":20435422,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDM1NDIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20435422?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rong1981","html_url":"https://github.com/rong1981","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rong1981/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rong1981/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rong1981/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rong1981/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rong1981/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rong1981/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rong1981/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rong1981/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rong1981/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":7331964,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMxOTY0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/labels/type/bug","name":"type/bug","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":"Bugs to being fixed"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/milestones/5","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/dubbo/milestone/5","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/milestones/5/labels","id":2763929,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMjc2MzkyOQ==","number":5,"title":"2.5.7","description":"此版本计划包含以下几部分：完善Annotation、XML两种配置形式，并考虑集成Spring Boot启动方式；为docker等容器部署环境提供支持；社区反馈的issue、PR处理。","creator":{"login":"chickenlj","id":18097545,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDk3NTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18097545?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj","html_url":"https://github.com/chickenlj","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":22,"state":"closed","created_at":"2017-09-14T01:05:08Z","updated_at":"2017-11-03T14:39:59Z","due_on":"2017-10-31T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2017-11-03T14:39:59Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2017-10-31T15:18:34Z","updated_at":"2019-06-25T07:32:12Z","closed_at":"2017-11-02T07:19:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### 问题描述\r\n使用Spring Boot构建web app，Controller中通过dubbo消费端远程调用服务端，使用注解进行参数校验，如getName(@NotNull String id)。\r\n在调用过程中始终报错：\r\n\r\njava.lang.RuntimeException: XXXService_GetNameParameter: frozen class (cannot edit)\r\n\tat javassist.ClassPool.checkNotFrozen(ClassPool.java:617) ~[javassist-3.21.0-GA.jar:?]\r\n\tat javassist.ClassPool.makeClass(ClassPool.java:859) ~[javassist-3.21.0-GA.jar:?]\r\n\tat javassist.ClassPool.makeClass(ClassPool.java:836) ~[javassist-3.21.0-GA.jar:?]\r\n\tat com.alibaba.dubbo.validation.support.jvalidation.JValidator.getMethodParameterBean(JValidator.java:166) \r\n### 问题分析\r\n1. 初步判断和dubbo版本无关，应该是一个bug。报错的原因是再次尝试查找动态生成的类时，应该能找到，实际上因为classloader的原因无法找到。即com.alibaba.dubbo.validation.support.jvalidation.JValidator第163行：\r\n`parameterClass = (Class<?>) Class.forName(parameterClassName, true, clazz.getClassLoader());`\r\n这里应该能够找到parameterClass，而不是再次抛出ClassNotFoundException。\r\n2. 出现ClassNotFoundException的原因，是由于在生成参数类XXXService_GetNameParameter的时候，没有传入该参数的接口的classLoader（即clazz.getClassLoader），而是使用了默认的Context ClassLoader。\r\n3. 建议修改JValidator第202行为：\r\n`parameterClass = ctClass.toClass(clazz.getClassLoader(), null);`传入接口的classLoader，保证其一致性。\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"chickenlj","id":18097545,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDk3NTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18097545?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj","html_url":"https://github.com/chickenlj","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/796/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"